[node name="ContractText" type="Label3D" parent="Geometry"]
transform = Transform3D(0.42262, 0, 0.90631, 0, 1, 0, -0.90631, 0, 0.42262, 19.35, 1.9, 3.17)
modulate = Color(0.95, 0.95, 0.9, 1)
font_size = 26
outline_size = 6
horizontal_alignment = 0
width = 860
autowrap_mode = 3
text = "CONTRACT · BLACKWATER PUMPING STATION
Scheduled for demolition. Recover what you can.

CONTRACT   VFD power module · control room · 1,000 cr
JACKPOT    pump motor · pump hall · 1,800 cr
           too heavy to carry: hoist it onto the trolley
BONUS      pressure transmitters · maintenance pit · 150 cr each

Unbolt salvage with the WRENCH [1] (hold LMB on the bolts).
Knocks and water cost value. Bring salvage to the DEPOSIT ZONE.
Start the TRUCK to leave, any time: secured salvage gets paid."

[node name="Water" type="Node3D" parent="."]
editor_description = "One flood zone for the whole station, measured from the pit floor (y = -3). Its volumes under the hall and passage only show once the pit is full.
WaterMain pours in through the inlet (and any burst pipe) until its valve is cranked shut; the zone's own seepage never stops."

